# Madame Web's "Whenever you attack, you may mill a card" can be declined (CR 701.17a, 603.5): she attacks on turn 3 and Bot1 declines,
# so the only card in the graveyard is the spent Black Lotus and the library keeps its Island on top.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Madame Web, Clairvoyant
Island
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Madame Web, Clairvoyant.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Madame Web, Clairvoyant > Bot2)
Bot1.Decline
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot2.Life = 16
